 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A bear named Wojtek joined the army and got promoted.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 2.776
  },
  {
   "text": "He drank beer straight from the bottle and rode around in army trucks.",
   "s": 3.076,
   "e": 6.339
  },
  {
   "text": "It started in Iran, when Polish soldiers swapped chocolate for a bear cub.",
   "s": 6.639,
   "e": 10.212
  },
  {
   "text": "They fed the cub condensed milk from an old vodka bottle.",
   "s": 10.512,
   "e": 13.188
  },
  {
   "text": "At night, he curled up next to the soldiers, like a giant furry dog.",
   "s": 13.488,
   "e": 16.999
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he grew, until he stood taller than the men.",
   "s": 17.299,
   "e": 19.239
  },
  {
   "text": "He raided the fruit tent and wrestled anyone who dared.",
   "s": 19.539,
   "e": 22.023
  },
  {
   "text": "He loved the showers so much, he learned to turn them on himself.",
   "s": 22.323,
   "e": 25.113
  },
  {
   "text": "One night, he found a spy hiding in the bath house.",
   "s": 25.763,
   "e": 28.026
  },
  {
   "text": "Wojtek roared, the spy screamed, and the soldiers grabbed him.",
   "s": 28.326,
   "e": 30.995
  },
  {
   "text": "But then the ship to Italy said: no pets allowed.",
   "s": 31.295,
   "e": 33.326
  },
  {
   "text": "So the Poles enlisted Wojtek as a private, with a rank and a number.",
   "s": 33.626,
   "e": 37.007
  },
  {
   "text": "And that wasn't even the craziest part.",
   "s": 37.307,
   "e": 38.961
  },
  {
   "text": "At Monte Cassino, he watched the men carry heavy crates of shells.",
   "s": 39.261,
   "e": 42.58
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he grabbed one himself. And another. And another.",
   "s": 42.88,
   "e": 45.248
  },
  {
   "text": "He never dropped a single one.",
   "s": 45.548,
   "e": 46.93
  },
  {
   "text": "So the company changed its badge to a bear carrying a shell.",
   "s": 47.23,
   "e": 49.852
  },
  {
   "text": "Trucks, flags and jackets all carried that bear.",
   "s": 50.152,
   "e": 52.325
  },
  {
   "text": "After the war, he retired to a Scottish zoo.",
   "s": 52.625,
   "e": 54.558
  },
  {
   "text": "Old soldiers visited, chatted with him in Polish, and tossed him treats.",
   "s": 54.858,
   "e": 58.399
  },
  {
   "text": "That's how a bear got promoted to corporal.",
   "s": 58.699,
   "e": 60.431
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow for a new weird story every day.",
   "s": 60.731,
   "e": 62.529
  }
 ],
